0..72 Comment "// A seat\'s dialogue with its operator: both endpoints\' moves in the one"
73..150 Comment "// order a recorder saw them, the seat on the left following its protocol and"
151..228 Comment "// the operator on the right following the dual. A dialogue\'s logical time is"
229..290 Comment "// its causal web, not its log (Mazurkiewicz, _Trace Theory_,"
291..364 Comment "// doi:10.1007/3-540-17906-2_30): each endpoint\'s own order and each send"
365..435 Comment "// before its receipt. Two logs that commute independent moves are one"
436..510 Comment "// dialogue, and `decompose` reads the web\'s modular decomposition back as"
511..562 Comment "// data (Gallai, _Transitiv orientierbare Graphen_,"
563..590 Comment "// doi:10.1007/BF02020961)."
592..632 Comment "// The seat\'s protocol and its messages."
